AP &= CP \quad \Rightarrow \quad \sqrt{(x-8)^2 + y^2 + z^2} = \sqrt{x^2 + y^2 + (z-6)^2}, \\
AP &= DP \quad \Rightarrow \quad \sqrt{(x-8)^2 + y^2 + z^2} = \sqrt{x^2 + y^2 + z^2}.
\end{align*}
\] Simplifying these, we get: \[
