x^2 - 16x + 64 + y^2 + z^2 &= x^2 + y^2 + 8y + 16 + z^2 \\
x^2 - 16x + y^2 + z^2 &= x^2 + y^2 + z^2 - 12z + 36 \\
\end{align*}
\] Simplifying further, we get: \[
\begin{align*}
-16x + 64 &= -8y + 16 \\
